<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>From the day that I first met You.</l><l>How could I help falling in love with You?</l><l>Emptiness turned life’s pleasures blue;</l><l>No earthly love ever could see me through.</l><l>’Till I turned one day</l><l>Opened up my heart,</l><l>Let Your love flow in</l><l>And fill my deepest part.</l><l>Now I know, Lord, You’re one with me;</l><l>And I can’t help giving myself to Thee.</l><l>Lord, I can’t help giving myself to Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
